&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt; Content Strategist &amp;amp; AI Copy Lead&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;London, United Kingdom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As Content Strategist &amp;amp; AI Copy Lead, you&#39;ll own positioning, messaging, and copy across a B2B payments business where clarity, accuracy, and trust matter. You&#39;ll build and maintain the copy generation frameworks, prompts, and tone-of-voice guardrails that allow AI tools — including the Pencil platform — to produce on-brand first drafts at volume, and you&#39;ll bring the critical editorial eye to shape and improve what comes out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;You won&#39;t be starting from scratch. You&#39;ll work within an established content strategy and system, helping it evolve as new brand work lands and business priorities shift. As the studio matures through the year, you&#39;ll take on greater ownership of intake, briefing, and prioritisation — playing a central role in how the studio runs day to day. This is a senior role for someone who moves confidently between strategic thinking and hands-on craft without losing quality at either end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own positioning, messaging frameworks, and campaign narratives for Client&#39;s products, propositions, and sectors — answering the strategic content question before production begins, so the studio can move at pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and edit high-quality copy across web, email, social, digital advertising, sales collateral, product datasheets, presentations, and video scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead thought leadership content — foundational articles and their supporting social and digital assets — in line with the agreed content strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain copy generation frameworks in Pencil and other approved AI tools, including prompts, templates, tone-of-voice rules, and message libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, direct, and refine AI-generated copy with a rigorous editorial eye — identifying errors, inconsistencies, and off-brand language, and correcting them through prompt refinement or direct editing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with compliance, legal, and risk stakeholders to ensure content is clear, fair, and not misleading — and embed their requirements into copy frameworks from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support PR with rapid-turnaround content and Sales Enablement with always-current messaging as new products, features, and sectors come online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write scripts and narratives for the Motion &amp;amp; Content Production Lead, and develop messaging for the studio&#39;s templates and collateral.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Marketing, Brand, PR, Sales Enablement, and Internal Communications to plan and prioritise content against commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run studio intake, briefing, and prioritisation with the Project Manager, taking full ownership as the studio&#39;s operations mature through the year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use content performance insight to refine messaging frameworks over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share Gen AI learnings and techniques across the studio, contributing to a culture of continuous experimentation and improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a senior copywriter, content strategist, or content lead in an agency, in-house team, or content studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to develop positioning, messaging frameworks, and campaign narratives from complex product and business information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing and editing skills across long and short form — from thought leadership articles to headlines, emails, and social posts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building reusable content tools: tone-of-voice guides, message houses, prompt libraries, or content templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical editorial eye: able to assess AI-generated copy quickly and improve it through prompt refinement or direct editing — not simply approve it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with senior stakeholders and turning competing requests into clear, prioritised content plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation and the ability to manage multiple requests at pace, including triaging briefs and managing stakeholder expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in what AI can do for content and creativity, with awareness of the ethical and legal considerations involved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Useful but not essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Pencil or an equivalent AI creative platform (training on Pencil will be provided).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in financial services, payments, fintech, or B2B technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with writing in a regulated environment, including financial promotions or Consumer Duty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SEO, content performance measurement, or content management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating B2B sales enablement content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced use of Gen AI tools — such as ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini — to enhance copy quality and content output, including hands-on prompting, model selection, and workflow design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI-assisted workflows for yourself and others to improve efficiency and output quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to train others on effective AI tool use and share best practice across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic approach to complex, multi-step content challenges — breaking briefs into components and finding efficient, high-quality routes to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI capabilities and limitations, with rigorous human oversight and editorial judgement applied throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
