&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Phiture as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Growth Consultant, PM&lt;/strong&gt;, owning the day-to-day relationship, communication, and delivery for one of our largest and most demanding accounts. You&#39;ll act as one of the main points of contact for client communications, owning conversations and decisions directly with the client, orchestrating across PM, ASO, and Creative, while advising the Growth Lead on strategy and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, individual account-ownership role that requires both strong technical craftsmanship and genuine comfort leading client conversations. &lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition for mobile apps, including GAC, Apple Search Ads, MMPs&lt;/strong&gt;, and attribution, and pair it with the confidence to represent the account&#39;s strategy directly to senior, demanding stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Paid UA Campaign Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the end-to-end strategy, setup, and continuous optimization of paid campaigns (Google App Campaigns, Apple Search Ads, Meta Ads and other UA channels as relevant) to scale user acquisition efficiently, proactively monitoring spend efficiency and creative performance, and independently investigating technical issues (tracking discrepancies, delivery problems, attribution mismatches) before escalating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Client Relationship&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the client relationship end-to-end with day-to-day communication, deliverables (reports, proposals, strategic planning docs), and hands-on execution of the agreed strategy. Lead client meetings, educate clients beyond reporting, and communicate the real, accurate cause of any issue, including when it traces back to our own setup or execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, Not Just Attend, Client Conversations&lt;/strong&gt;: Confidently drive client meetings, questioning client requests that don&#39;t hold up, proactively bringing recommendations rather than waiting to be asked, and representing the account&#39;s strategic direction directly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect PM to ASO and Creative&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively bring the organic and creative perspective into paid conversations (and vice versa) rather than staying within a single channel, by flagging cross-functional implications to the wider team without needing to be prompted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply App-Specific Paid Media Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition specifically for mobile apps, SDKs and their implementation, SKAN&#39;s measurement restrictions and their implications for testing and attribution, and what an MMP does and why app marketers rely on one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze Performance &amp;amp; Drive Recommendations&lt;/strong&gt;: Dive deep into monthly metrics, set targets, analyze trends, and independently identify areas of concern or opportunity, arriving with a point of view and a recommendation grounded in the numbers, translated into what it means for the client&#39;s business. Comfort reading dashboards in a tool like Looker Studio is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide Client POCs &amp;amp; Junior Team Members&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide Client POCs and junior team members as they build expertise, while retaining individual ownership of your own accounts. Given a problem, investigate it, propose a course of action, follow through, and close the loop with stakeholders without needing reminders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in paid user acquisition / performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, for mobile apps, with a track record of demonstrable results (efficiency gains, scaled spend, measurable campaign impact) you can speak to concretely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid app-specific paid UA fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: including GAC, Meta Ads, Apple Search Ads, SDKs, SKAN, and MMP concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on attribution/MMP experience&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable troubleshooting tracking and attribution issues directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine confidence leading client meetings&lt;/strong&gt;: with a track record of proactively driving conversations and pushing back on client asks when warranted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent data interpretation skills&lt;/strong&gt;: able to arrive at a point of view and recommendation grounded in the numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English, with excellent written and spoken client communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and being able to simplify technical concepts for less growth-literate stakeholders without losing substance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A demonstrated track record of proactive ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: able to walk through a real past troubleshooting or client-management example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with kids/family-audience apps&lt;/strong&gt; or highly regulated/brand-sensitive clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with programmatic/DSP media buying&lt;/strong&gt; is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience working alongside a dedicated data/attribution specialist&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable collaborating closely with a technical counterpart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work&lt;/strong&gt; — Unlimited remote work within your home country (EMEA), plus up to 90 days per year internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Vacation Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy up to 30 days of paid vacation annually, plus extra days for special occasions (country-specific), so you can recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quarterly Bonus Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; — Boost your earnings through our quarterly bonus scheme, directly linked to our shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellness Prioritized&lt;/strong&gt; — Free, confidential mental health support from licensed therapists through our partnership with Oliva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development Investment&lt;/strong&gt; — €1,000 annual personal growth budget and 10 dedicated learning hours each month, empowering your continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/strong&gt; — Shape your workday around your lifestyle and productivity, choosing working patterns that best suit you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vibrant Berlin Office&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy a flexible, pet-friendly workspace at our spacious headquarters located in one of Berlin’s most vibrant neighborhoods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Team Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Regular team-building events and a memorable annual all-expenses-paid company offsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; — A personalized career roadmap and development plan designed to keep you advancing professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Monthly remote-work cash allowance to level up your home workspace or help cover internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Onboarding Kit&lt;/strong&gt; — Branded Phiture gear and your very own MacBook from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Celebrations&lt;/strong&gt; — Responsibly sourced birthday, anniversary, and seasonal gifts, because every milestone deserves recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Backend Engineer – Java&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: London (Hybrid) | Practice Area: Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | Type: Permanent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable backend solutions that help shape the future of financial services.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is growing our Engineering team, and we’re looking for experienced Principal Backend Engineers with strong Java skills and a passion for delivering innovative solutions in financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Backend Engineer at Capco, you’ll contribute to high-impact, client-facing projects and work with cloud-native technologies across different domains within Financial Services &amp;amp; Energy. You’ll collaborate with talented engineers, contribute to architecture and engineering decisions, and have access to industry-leading learning and development opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also use approved AI tools, automation and AI-enabled engineering workflows where appropriate to improve development speed, quality and productivity, while applying human judgement, responsible AI guardrails and appropriate review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and deliver scalable backend services using Java 11, 17+, designing APIs and microservices for enterprise systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work across cloud platforms, particularly AWS, applying cloud-native deployment techniques and contributing to architecture and solution design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop robust automated test coverage across unit, component, integration, end-to-end and performance testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with clients, product managers and engineers in agile teams to design, deliver and troubleshoot large-scale distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use approved AI tools, automation and AI-enabled workflows to support engineering activities such as development, testing, troubleshooting and documentation, with appropriate human review and responsible AI controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expertise in Java 11, 17+ and Spring Boot, with experience designing and delivering large-scale enterprise backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with cloud-native and distributed architectures, including microservices, event-driven patterns and CQRS, preferably deployed within AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with CI/CD, Infrastructure as Code such as CloudFormation, and SQL and NoSQL databases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Kafka, Java streaming, automated testing and troubleshooting distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity and practical experience using approved AI, GenAI or AI-enabled development tools to improve engineering productivity, with an understanding of human-in-the-loop review, responsible AI, guardrails and escalation where required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An appetite to contribute to the wider Capco business through activities such as thought leadership, supporting RFPs and coaching or mentoring engineering colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with GitLab for CI/CD processes and experience writing automation test cases in Cucumber using Behaviour Driven Development (BDD).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect – Associate or Professional level certification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of security best practices, including IAM Roles and KMS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience exploring responsible AI-enabled engineering practices, including automation or Agentic AI workflows, while maintaining appropriate review, auditability and human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across FS &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; 8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Your growth, your way – minimum 40 hours of training annually. Take your pick from workshops, certifications and e-learning. Plus, a Business Coach assigned from Day One provides one-to-one guidance to support your goals and accelerate your development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Convenient online GP services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know – we’ll be happy to help. We value each person’s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration – a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager, Enterprise Sales to join our team of creatives, engineers, marketers, and brilliant business folks. You aren&#39;t the typical sales leader, and we aren&#39;t the typical design tool company. At Figma, we challenge assumptions and remove the constraints that block our imagination every day, and we expect you to do the same. With this role, you&#39;ll get in at the ground floor in a fast-growing sales org. You&#39;ll consult with our existing customer base and potential customers to build meaningful relationships that add value to the customer experience and revenue to our bottom line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Our next team member will have an agile, dynamic mindset, be comfortable embracing change, be a true team-player, and love working with our growing footprint of Fortune 1000 customers. You won&#39;t be alone! Figma has an incredible team, and you&#39;ll work closely with other groups including Support, Design, Engineering, Product Marketing, Customer Success, and Community. As a Senior Manager, Enterprise Sales, you will lead a team of Account Executives responsible for continuing the growth of our Enterprise products. You will report directly to our Head of Sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a full-time role that can be held from our London hub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead a team of motivated and diverse individuals to foster an environment of success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Participate in customer and prospect meetings alongside your team to support deal progression and coach in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Assist in continual training and development, including mentorship, hiring, and career growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Help shape and further develop sales processes and initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Interview, hire, and train new team members as we scale the business and company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deliver weekly forecast meetings and advise Account Executives on strategies to help exceed their goal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;7+ years of sales experience (preferably within SaaS) with 2+ years of management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Understanding of our technical and competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to thrive in a constantly changing and evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Exceptional coaching, writing, discovery, and presentation skills and excitement for increasing customer happiness and developing lasting customer relationships through strong discovery and partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven track record of leading successful and consistent sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you&#39;re excited about this role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;Help-make-the-world-more-hospitable&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;295&quot;&gt;Help make the world more hospitable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;332&quot;&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that&#39;s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we&#39;re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences. You&#39;ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You&#39;ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you&#39;ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we&#39;re building. If you&#39;re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you&#39;ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;About-the-role&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;977&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;993&quot;&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It&#39;s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;The Guest Revenue tribe owns the products that help hotels earn more from every guest interaction: our booking engine, upselling tools, ancillary revenue features, and the guest recognition layer that makes personalization possible. You&#39;ll sit directly alongside Diana Arizmendi (Director of Product and Engineering) as her right hand on the tribe&#39;s hardest product problems: improving upsell attach rates (currently ~2%), scaling guest recognition, and shipping the Reputation Manager into GA. You won&#39;t be running discovery yourself for every feature — instead, you&#39;ll own the tribe&#39;s product context and encode your product judgment into the agents, evals, and shared systems that the Product Builders draw on autonomously. When the system doesn&#39;t produce the right output, you fix it at the root. When the tribe faces a genuinely ambiguous strategic bet, you own the answer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-you-would-do&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2242&quot;&gt;What you would do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product context your team builds from: the customer evidence, outcome definitions, prioritisation logic and decision history that makes every build decision faster and more grounded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encode your product thinking into shared tools and systems so that good problem framing and rigorous discovery happen by default, not through constant oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery on the team&#39;s hardest open questions, from improving how guests discover and accept offers to building the data layer that makes guest recognition reliable at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Director of Product and Engineering on complex strategic calls, cross functional alignment and the decisions that have the most long term leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Staff Engineers and Staff Designers to make sure product decisions hold up technically and create experiences guests actually notice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5562&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role, that means you design the agents and shared workflows your product builders use to turn customer evidence into decisions, not just use AI tools yourself. You build an approach to discovery and context management that others on the team can pick up and run with on their own, and you are the one who checks whether an AI generated recommendation actually holds up before it shapes a commercial decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6000&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0bjKvDcjp5 _0WKd3G4z3T _23rrnHo10F _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9DjOvk _3932vv0Rl6 _02cRtH6wH8 _1B4rbIo10F _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGijOvk _0NqVRt0Rl6 _3BKYwu6wH8 _3sFUREDdj4 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-you-would-bring&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3331&quot;&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6179&quot;&gt;Staff or Principal level product experience: you have led the strategy for a meaningful product surface in B2B SaaS, and you set direction rather than execute it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6345&quot;&gt;A commercial mindset: you naturally reason in outcomes, revenue and business impact, and you can speak to how your product decisions moved a metric that mattered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6511&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 3 or the equivalent hands on experience: you have redesigned how a team works using AI, built an approach others followed, and you actively check AI output rather than taking it at face value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6724&quot;&gt;Technical fluency: you hold your own in engineering conversations, understand trade offs at the architecture level, and can translate technical constraints into product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6907&quot;&gt;Experience building reusable product systems: you have encoded your thinking into frameworks, agents or tooling that others actually use, not just documentation that lives in a wiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 491 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2 519 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£81,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£107,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Sweden&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;849 000 kr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 333 000 kr SEK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€125.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The ideal candidate will be based in London and should be willing and able to travel across Europe for additional client engagements as needed.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
